[00:00.00] 作词 : Avicii/Jordan Suecof/Nicholas Furlong/Gabriel Benjamin/John Feldmann/Ash Pournouri
[00:00.38] 作曲 : Avicii/Jordan Suecof/Nicholas Furlong/Gabriel Benjamin/John Feldmann/Ash Pournouri
[00:00.77]Once upon a younger year
{"曾经年少的时候"}
[00:04.47]When all our shadows disappeared
{"当所有的阴霾都消散"}
[00:06.44]The animals inside came out to play
{"内心的野兽跑出来嬉闹"}
[00:10.15]Went face to face with all our fears
{"直面我们所有的恐惧"}
[00:12.31]Learned our lessons through the tears
{"在泪水中汲取了教训"}
[00:13.91]Made memories we knew would never fade
{"留下了永不褪色的记忆"}
[00:17.22]One day my father he told me
{"有一天父亲对我说"}
[00:19.31]Son don't let it slip away
{"孩子，别让时光虚度"}
[00:21.58]He took me in his arms I heard him say
{"他把我搂在怀里，我听见他说"}
[00:24.94]When you get older
{"当你渐渐长大"}
[00:26.35]Your wild heart will live for younger days
{"你狂野的心会为青春跳动"}
[00:29.36]Think of me if ever you're afraid
{"若是害怕，就想想我"}
[00:32.45]He said one day you'll leave this world behind
{"他说，总有一天你会离开这世界"}
[00:36.29]So live a life you will remember
{"所以去过值得铭记的一生"}
[00:40.14]My father told me when I was just a child
{"父亲在我还是孩子时告诉我"}
[00:43.92]These are the nights that never die
{"这些夜晚将永不消逝"}
[00:47.32]My father told me
{"父亲曾对我说"}
[01:18.81]When thunder clouds start pouring down
{"当乌云开始倾泻暴雨"}
[01:20.85]Light a fire they can't put out
{"就燃起他们无法扑灭的火焰"}
[01:22.78]Carve your name into those shining stars
{"把你的名字刻在闪耀的群星上"}
[01:25.72]He said go venture far beyond the shores
{"他说，去远方的海岸冒险吧"}
[01:28.42]Don't forsake this life of yours
{"不要辜负你的人生"}
[01:30.26]I'll guide you home no matter where you are
{"无论你在哪里，我都会指引你回家"}
[01:33.49]One day my father he told me
{"有一天父亲对我说"}
[01:35.52]Son don't let it slip away
{"孩子，别让时光虚度"}
[01:37.77]When I was just a kid I heard him say
{"当我还是个孩子时　我听见他说"}
[01:41.12]When you get older
{"当你长大以后"}
[01:42.51]Your wild heart will live for younger days
{"你狂野的心会为年轻的日子而活"}
[01:45.58]Think of me if ever you're afraid
{"如果你害怕　就想想我"}
[01:48.69]He said one day you'll leave this world behind
{"他说总有一天你会离开这个世界"}
[01:52.41]So live a life you will remember
{"所以活出值得铭记的人生"}
[01:56.27]My father told me when I was just a child
{"我父亲告诉我　当我还是个孩子时"}
[02:00.08]These are the nights that never die
{"这些夜晚永不消逝"}
